msgid "Libraries"
msgstr ""

#: ../../start/the-console.rst:25 057e4763b826450982bcd22867ae4fed
msgid ""
"``/libraries/list/`` - every library, from MHVTL's own configuration. "
"Each card has its id, model, serial, and buttons for the things done most"
" often."
msgstr ""

